<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine February producer prices rise 0.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine February producer prices rise 0.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's producer prices rose 0.4 percent in February, the same as in January, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE PRODUCER PRICES   Feb 97   Jan 97   Feb 96</p>
<p>    mth/mth			 +0.4     +0.4     +2.9</p>
<p>The Ministry did not provide year-on-year figures.</p>
<p>Producer prices rose 17.3 percent in 1996 after 172.1 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
